<div class="wb-body">
  <header class="wb-header">
    <button type="button" class="wb-portrait" data-action="pickPortrait" data-tooltip="Change portrait" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
      <img src="{{actor.img}}" alt="{{actor.name}}">
    </button>
    <div class="wb-identity">
      <span class="wb-eyebrow">Character</span>
      <input class="wb-name" type="text" name="name" value="{{actor.name}}" placeholder="Name" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
    </div>
    <label class="wb-level">
      <span class="wb-eyebrow">Level</span>
      <input type="number" name="system.level" value="{{system.level}}" min="1" step="1" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
    </label>
  </header>

  <section class="wb-resources" aria-label="Resources">
    {{#each resources as |resource|}}
    <div class="wb-resource wb-resource-{{resource.key}}">
      <label class="wb-resource-label">
        <span class="wb-eyebrow">{{resource.label}}</span>
        <span class="wb-resource-values">
          <input type="number" name="{{resource.inputName}}" value="{{resource.value}}" step="any" aria-label="Current {{resource.label}}" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          <span class="wb-resource-max" aria-label="Maximum {{resource.label}}">/ {{resource.max}}</span>
        </span>
      </label>
      <label class="wb-override-label">
        <span>Max override</span>
        <input type="number" name="system.{{resource.key}}.maxOverride" value="{{resource.maxOverride}}" placeholder="Auto" step="any" aria-label="{{resource.label}} maximum override; clear for automatic" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
      </label>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <div class="wb-wonder-rest">
    <p>{{#if defyFate}}Defy Fate: use Wonder on a failed check or save to declare a success. Initiative still rerolls.{{else}}Wonder rerolls a non-attack d20 roll. Uses equal your FTH modifier and return on a long rest.{{/if}}</p>
    <button type="button" data-action="longRest" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Long rest</button>
  </div>

  <section class="wb-core" aria-label="Core numbers">
    {{#each coreDetails as |detail|}}
    <div class="wb-core-detail">
      <span class="wb-eyebrow">{{detail.label}}</span>
      <strong class="wb-core-value">{{detail.value}} <small>{{detail.unit}}</small></strong>
      <label class="wb-override-label">
        <span>Override</span>
        <input type="{{detail.type}}" name="system.overrides.{{detail.key}}" value="{{detail.override}}" placeholder="Auto {{detail.automatic}}" step="any" aria-label="{{detail.label}} override; clear for automatic" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
      </label>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <fieldset class="wb-armor-bonuses">
    <legend>Worn armor and corrections</legend>
    <p>Armor type: {{worn.type}} · Armor AR {{worn.armorAR}} + shield AR {{worn.shieldAR}} · Light armor NE +{{worn.evasion}}</p>
    <label><span>Extra AR correction (added to items)</span><input type="number" name="system.bonuses.armor" value="{{system.bonuses.armor}}" step="any" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
    <label><span>Extra Evasion correction (added to items)</span><input type="number" name="system.bonuses.evasion" value="{{system.bonuses.evasion}}" step="any" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
    <p>Effective AGL {{worn.effectiveAgility}} · Armor penalty {{worn.agilityPenalty}} · Movement costs {{worn.squareCost}} ft per square ({{worn.difficultSquareCost}} ft in difficult terrain).</p>
    <label><span>Armor AGL penalty override (blank = auto)</span><input type="number" name="system.overrides.armorAgilityPenalty" value="{{system.overrides.armorAgilityPenalty}}" placeholder="{{worn.automaticPenalty}}" step="any" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
    {{#if worn.heavyDisadvantage}}<p>Heavy armor with STR below 21: attacks, Dodges and AGL saves have disadvantage. Choose disadvantage when rolling an AGL save.</p>{{/if}}
    <p>Block: {{block.formula}} {{block.strMod}} STR{{#unless block.fromShield}} (no shield equipped){{/unless}}. Another Block die at level {{block.nextLevel}}. You need arm guards, a weapon or a shield to Block.</p>
    <button type="button" class="wb-block-action" data-action="block" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Block · {{block.formula}} {{block.strMod}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="wb-dodge-action" data-action="dodge" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Dodge · d20 {{dodgeMod}}</button>
    <button type="button" class="wb-parry-action" data-action="parry" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Parry · d20 {{parryMod}} · DEX 21 milestone</button>
    {{#each worn.duplicatePieces}}<p>Multiple equipped {{this}} records: their contributions are added. Review equipped items or use a correction if needed.</p>{{/each}}
  </fieldset>
  <p class="wb-core-hint">Equipped armor and shields now contribute automatically. Clear old manual armor totals to avoid counting them twice; the correction fields above add to equipped items. Final core-number overrides still replace the complete result. AGL score stays editable; modifiers, milestones, reactions and movement use effective AGL.</p>

  <section class="wb-stats">
    {{#each groups as |group|}}
    <div class="wb-group">
      <h2 class="wb-group-title">{{group.title}}</h2>
      <ol class="wb-stat-list">
        {{#each group.rows as |stat|}}
        <li class="wb-stat">
          <button type="button" class="wb-abbr" data-action="rollStat" data-stat="{{stat.key}}" data-tooltip="{{stat.label}} check or save: choose normal, advantage or disadvantage">{{stat.abbr}}</button>
          <span class="wb-label">{{stat.label}}</span>
          <input class="wb-score {{#if stat.manual}}is-manual{{/if}} {{#if stat.adjusted}}is-adjusted{{/if}}" type="number" name="statScores.{{stat.key}}" data-stat-score="{{stat.key}}" data-base="{{stat.baseValue}}" data-default="{{stat.defaultValue}}" data-effective="{{stat.value}}" data-manual="{{stat.manual}}" value="{{stat.value}}" step="1" aria-label="{{stat.label}} score; edit base score" data-tooltip="{{stat.label}}: {{stat.value}}. Select to edit your base score. Clear to reset the manual edit; effects still apply." {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>
          <span class="wb-mod {{#if stat.negative}}is-negative{{/if}}" aria-label="{{stat.label}} modifier">{{stat.modLabel}}</span>
          <span class="wb-pips">
            {{#each stat.pips as |pip|}}
            <span class="wb-pip {{#if pip.lit}}is-lit{{/if}}" data-tooltip="{{pip.score}}: {{pip.name}}"></span>
            {{/each}}
          </span>
        </li>
        {{/each}}
      </ol>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <section class="wb-equipment" aria-label="Equipment">
    <h2>Equipment</h2>
    <div class="wb-equipment-actions">
      <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="create" data-type="weapon" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add weapon</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="create" data-type="armor" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add armor</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="create" data-type="shield" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add shield</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="create" data-type="consumable" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add consumable</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="create" data-type="misc" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Add miscellaneous</button>
    </div>
    <div class="wb-inventory">
      <p class="wb-inventory-total {{#if carrying.over}}is-over{{/if}}"><strong>{{carrying.used}} / {{carrying.capacity}}</strong> inventory slots{{#if carrying.over}} · over by {{carrying.over}}{{/if}}</p>
      <label class="wb-equipment-check"><input type="checkbox" name="system.inventory.backpack" {{#if system.inventory.backpack}}checked{{/if}} {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}> Backpack (+6 slots)</label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Slots override</span><input type="number" name="system.overrides.inventorySlots" value="{{system.overrides.inventorySlots}}" placeholder="Auto {{carrying.automatic}}" step="any" aria-label="Inventory slots override; clear for automatic" {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}></label>
    </div>
    <p class="wb-core-hint">You have 10 + STR modifier slots. Worn armor and weapons or shields in hand take none. Drop items here from the Items directory, or add your own. Each leg-guard item is a complete pair. Equip a weapon to attack with it.</p>
    <ul class="wb-equipment-list">
      {{#each equipment}}
      <li data-item-id="{{id}}">
        <button type="button" class="wb-equipment-name" data-action="equipment" data-operation="edit">{{name}}</button>
        <span>{{typeLabel}} · Qty {{quantity}} · {{#if equipped}}{{#if slots}}{{slots}} slots for extras{{else}}worn or in hand{{/if}}{{else}}{{slots}} slots{{/if}}</span>
        <p>{{detail}}</p>
        <div class="wb-equipment-actions">
          {{#if canAttack}}<button type="button" class="wb-attack-button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="attack" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Attack</button>{{/if}}
          {{#if canReload}}<button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="reload" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Reload</button>{{/if}}
          {{#if canUse}}<button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="use" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Use one</button>{{/if}}
          {{#if canEquip}}<button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="toggle" aria-pressed="{{equipped}}" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if equipped}}Equipped{{else}}Equip{{/if}}</button>{{/if}}
          <button type="button" data-action="equipment" data-operation="delete" {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}>Remove</button>
        </div>
      </li>
      {{else}}<li>No equipment yet.</li>{{/each}}
    </ul>
  </section>
  <p class="wb-hint">Click a stat for a check or save with normal dice, advantage or disadvantage. Use Wonder from its chat card. The diamonds light up at 21 and 28.</p>
</div>
